        "assessment": "SshChannelMultiplexer.handleResponse invokes the existing beforeResolve callback before resolving the Promise. The relay schedules pumpChunks with setImmediate after returning metadata, and ordered transport writes keep its metadata ahead of its chunks. No new relay capability is required."
